WEBVTT

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:41.200
What?!

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:53.740
Go...

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:55.450
Shoot!

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:22.250
Takao and Max's semi-final opponents are
the dark parts hunters, King and Queen.

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:26.730
They're cruel Bladers who'll do
anything to take parts from people.

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:32.160
Takao and Max fought an
intense battle, and won!

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.050
They got revenge for Kane and Jim,
and advance to the finals!

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:41.470
And the Doctor's plan to steal the four
Sacred Beasts goes up in smoke.

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:46.380
What...?

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:00.400
--Good morning!

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:03.200
Good morning!

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.740
You guys are early!

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:06.120
Of course!

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:09.720
It's Kai and Rei's
semi-final match!

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:11.810
How do you feel, Rei?

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:14.140
I feel great!

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:17.140
Good. But don't let
your guard down.

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:20.840
Zeo managed to
beat Ozma, after all.

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:22.860
Yeah...

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:24.320
Where's Kai?

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:31.820
Don't keep us waiting, Kai.

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:34.880
We're all ready to go.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:40.840
Get out there and
wrap this up.

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:44.740
Kinomiya.
I will defeat Zeo.

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:49.750
And I will fight
you in the finals.

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:52.610
Yeah. I'll be waiting.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:04:00.050
Go, Burning Cerberus!

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:05.140
Orthros!

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:15.820
Time to go.

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:25.200
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:29.340
Only two matches to go for the
2002 Beyblade world championships!

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:31.010
The end is nigh!

00:04:31.010 --> 00:04:35.210
Allow me to introduce the two
teams in this semi-final match!

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:38.500
Firstly, the team that won their way
up with their indomitable strength!

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.740
The Kai/Rei team!

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:44.640
You can do it, Rei, Kai!

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:45.970
You better win!

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:48.100
We'll be waiting
in the finals!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:51.570
Their opponents will be the team that has
shown us how powerful they really are!

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:55.370
The new stars of the 2002 tournament! The Zeo/Gordo team!

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:58.820
Zeo...

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:04.820
Who's going to win and fight the
Takao/Max team in the finals?

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:08.060
Will it be the talented
Kai/Rei team?

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:11.520
Or the 2002 new stars,
the Zeo/Gordo team?

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:13.800
Keep watching!

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:21.240
I don't know what
you're up to, Zagart.

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:25.260
But I cannot allow you to
have the four Sacred Beasts.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:28.930
Good luck, Rei and Kai.

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:32.620
The first battle will
be Rei VS Gordo!

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:35.700
Don't hold back.
Show him what you can do.

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:36.700
Sure.

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:44.240
Takao, stop zoning out
and cheer them on!

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:45.610
I know!

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:48.500
Rei! Knock that guy flying!

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:51.330
Zeo's after the
four Sacred Beasts.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:53.500
I wonder if
they'll be alright.

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:56.980
At this point, we just
have to believe in them.

00:05:56.980 --> 00:05:59.010
We're counting on you, Rei!

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:02.340
Are you ready?

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:09.930
Three! Two! One!

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:12.250
Go, Shoot!

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:13.660
Shoot!

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:17.780
Driger!

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:23.080
Rei makes the first move
using his amazing speed!

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.660
Go!

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:26.980
What?!

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:30.180
He dodged
Rei's fast attacks!

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:32.100
He dodged Driger!

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:33.560
And how confidently!

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:36.220
He just got lucky!
Shake it off, Rei!

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.130
This time for sure!

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:40.680
Driger!

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:44.840
Gordo's amazing!
He's predicting Driger's next moves!

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:46.840
No way!

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:49.180
Driger's speed is a
part of the equation.

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:52.720
Your attacks can't
catch Orthros.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:01.130
That's the speedy Driger?
Not as good as they say.

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:02.240
What?!

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:03.850
Go!

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:08.450
Gordo's controlling the pace!

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:12.090
Calm down! You can't
fall into his rhythm!

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:13.200
Rei!!

00:07:15.050 --> 00:07:16.460
Darn!

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:20.620
This is bad.

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:24.580
Driger is losing speed!

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:25.580
What?!

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:27.080
Time to wrap this up.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:31.260
Twin Spear!!

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:35.880
Driger!

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:37.180
Go!!

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:44.180
Gordo's fighting back!

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:47.270
Amazing! What power!

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:49.410
Rei's on defense!

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:51.000
It's the Blade Base!

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.380
Blade Base?

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:56.440
The heavier Blade Base
increases attack power!

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:59.720
And it has an Attack Ring
that can attack repeatedly!

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:03.330
If this keeps up, Driger
will be destroyed!

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:04.800
What?!

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:06.500
Run! You have to run!

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:07.610
Rei!

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:14.000
Dodge! Dodge it!!

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:20.660
Come on, Rei!

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:22.760
Make some distance
and regroup!

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:24.080
He can't!

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:27.620
He used too much power
in those first attacks,

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:30.600
so Driger doesn't have
enough speed anymore!

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:32.300
Really, Kyoujyu?

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:35.280
So he baited Rei into...

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.840
We've taken your battle
styles into consideration.

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:43.400
The data uploaded into them is their greatest
weapon for stealing the four Sacred Beasts!

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:47.250
Go!

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:53.040
Blast...

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:53.800
Rei!

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:56.140
End this, Gordo!

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:58.840
Orthros!

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:06.920
I will not lose! Byakko!

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:19.530
Go, Orthros!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.970
Driger!!

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:32.100
Byakko...!

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:34.600
Go, Orthros!

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:41.880
Rei, hang in there!

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:42.970
You can do it!

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:44.290
Rei!

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:50.530
It's useless. Driger can't
withstand Orthros's attacks.

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:54.570
Go, Orthros!

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:04.260
Gordo's dealing out
an intense attack!

00:10:04.260 --> 00:10:06.800
Rei can't keep up!

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.770
Is he going to lose?

00:10:11.450 --> 00:10:13.000
Ozma...

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:14.810
Keep fighting, Rei!

00:10:14.810 --> 00:10:15.450
Rei!

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:16.730
Rei...!

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:19.210
No...

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:22.240
Driger's out of power!

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:23.340
What?!

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:26.090
Finish him off!
Twin Spear!!

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:31.560
Remember, Rei!

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:33.880
Remember when
you lost Byakko!

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:15.660
Did you forget that pain?

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:17.890
I would never!

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:20.220
I'll never go
through that again!

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:21.380
Byakko!

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:24.620
What?

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:29.300
Vulkan Power Claw!!

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:52.760
Which one?
Which one won?

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:56.770
What?!

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:02.520
A draw...

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:08.160
What an ending! This intense
first battle had ended in a draw!

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:14.640
That was close...

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:16.780
Don't scare me like that.

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:21.060
But now we know they're calculating
based on the BBA's battles.

00:12:21.060 --> 00:12:22.370
They have
to be careful!

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:23.400
Yeah...

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:28.520
Yes...

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:35.760
The committee has decided that Rei and
Gordo's Beys are unfit for a rematch.

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:41.800
So the winner of Kai and Zeo's
battle will advance to the finals.

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:58.420
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:05.480
Zeo VS Kai! The second battle is about to
begin and entry to the finals is riding on it!

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:06.980
Counting on you, Kai.

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:11.660
Let's go the finals together!
The battlefield that's waiting for us!

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:15.850
I'll take care of it.
I won't waste your battle.

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:18.300
It's time for Zeo's battle.

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:21.720
Don't worry,
Kai would never lose.

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:29.120
Kinomiya.
I will defeat Zeo.

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:32.950
And I will fight
you in the finals.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:40.320
You must obtain Suzaku.
No matter what it takes.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.300
Are you ready?

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:46.060
Three! Two! One!

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:47.410
Go...

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:50.220
Shoot!

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:54.980
Go!!

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.690
I will not be defeated!

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:59.980
The second battle
starts off strong!

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:02.220
Look at Kai's facial expression.

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:04.680
I've never seen him
look so intense.

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:06.780
Dranzer!!

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:11.020
Dranzer's making a push!
Is he going to end it now?

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:14.610
Great, Kai!
Keep up the attack!

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:16.210
Go!

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:22.650
Burning Cerberus!

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:34.520
He's still in! Cerberus
withstood Dranzer's assault!

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:37.140
He pushed Dranzer back...

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:39.580
He's so powerful!

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:44.410
His battle with Ozma
wasn't a fluke, then...

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:45.400
Zeo...

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:47.890
Go, Cerberus!

00:14:47.890 --> 00:14:50.640
Go, Dranzer!!

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:55.730
Amazing! Neither player
is giving an inch!

00:14:55.730 --> 00:14:58.340
It's a clash of power!

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:01.830
You've improved a little.

00:15:02.680 --> 00:15:05.290
All so I can take the
four Sacred Beasts.

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:07.730
Starting with your Suzaku!

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:09.940
Here he comes!

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:12.440
Cerberus!

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:30.170
Wow! It's powered up a lot
since its fight with Ozma!

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:31.650
It what?!

00:15:35.320 --> 00:15:37.160
No way...

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:41.320
Show them your
true power, Zeo.

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:44.290
Suzaku!!

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:51.480
Go, Cerberus!

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:52.810
Suzaku!

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:02.400
Go, Suzaku!

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:10.600
Dranzer can't fight back!

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:11.520
Kai!

00:16:12.520 --> 00:16:14.240
It's so powerful...

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:18.400
This is the power of
Cerberus--No, of Zeo!

00:16:18.400 --> 00:16:20.900
It would never
lose to Dranzer.

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:23.220
Go, Cerberus!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:28.520
--Suzaku!

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:30.140
Go!

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:34.820
Kai!

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:36.240
Go!

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:38.320
Cerberus is too strong!

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:43.080
Is this the end for the rulers
of power, the Kai/Rei team?!

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:46.740
This is bad!

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.720
Suzaku is losing power!

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:50.500
--What?!

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:51.890
Ozma...!

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:57.560
Kai!

00:16:57.560 --> 00:17:00.990
No... He's almost
out of power!

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:04.490
Finish him off,
Burning Cerberus!

00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:08.260
He's gonna lose!

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:09.740
This is the end!

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:10.720
Kai!

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:11.800
Kinomiya!

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:16.420
I thought you wanted to
fight me in the finals!

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:18.040
Kinomiya...

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:21.920
He's right.
I cannot accept defeat!

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:28.610
Dranzer is regaining power!

00:17:30.260 --> 00:17:31.410
What?!

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:33.000
Suzaku!

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:48.770
What happened?

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:55.700
Still spinning!

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:58.300
What amazing Beys!
What an amazing battle!

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:01.210
This is the world championships!

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:05.370
But the stadium is toast!

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:08.410
Can they even
continue the battle?

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:12.480
Burning Cerberus!

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:14.740
Dranzer!!

00:18:16.850 --> 00:18:18.490
Go!!

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:20.010
I have to win!

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:34.080
Go, Dranzer!

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:37.880
Burning Cerberus!

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:45.120
Kyoujyu!

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:47.180
They're completely even!

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:49.390
It's up to whoever
has more stamina!

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:50.210
Kai!

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:51.620
You gotta win!

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:52.500
Kai!

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:53.900
Zeo!

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:56.190
Dranzer!!

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:18.540
That noise...
It's the same as before!

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:24.780
Cerberus!

00:19:29.900 --> 00:19:31.480
It's the same noise...

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:35.120
Looks like we're through.

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:36.820
This is the end.

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:40.330
Volcano Excellent Emission!

00:19:44.610 --> 00:19:45.410
Zeo!

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:47.690
Burning Cerberus!

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:54.580
Chain Storm!!

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:12.820
Dranzer!

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:15.890
What about Cerberus?

00:20:18.890 --> 00:20:20.610
It's still spinning!

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:24.760
It's over! Zeo has won
this battle to the death!

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:28.620
The Zeo/Gordo team
go to the finals!

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:32.320
Cerberus!

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:44.630
Suzaku!

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:47.900
Join me, Suzaku!

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:54.560
Suzaku!

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:56.290
Stop!!

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:06.440
He stole Suzaku...!

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:08.140
No way...!

00:21:14.650 --> 00:21:15.880
Suzaku...

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:21.850
Suzaku!!

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:02.530
Kai lost his battle and
Zeo took Suzaku.

00:23:02.530 --> 00:23:05.820
Takao falls into a slump
before the finals.

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:09.000
The team is coming apart
at the most vital moment!

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:11.680
What? Takao and Kai
are going to battle?

00:23:11.680 --> 00:23:14.540
Is that another one
of your puns, Chairman?

00:23:14.540 --> 00:23:16.560
What? Look at the episode title?

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:19.200
Wow, you're right!
This is huge!

00:23:19.200 --> 00:23:22.140
Make sure you don't
miss the next episode!
